        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "acf5598d-ffd5-5276-86d3-b576a166cca7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Publications: Guitar World, Golf Digest\n- People: Daron Malakian\n- Companies: Condé Nast Publications, The New York Times Company\n- Places: United States, Des Moines, Iowa\n- Rankings: Guitar World's The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time\n\nFacts:\n- Golf Digest started in 1950.\n- The New York Times Company bought Golf Digest in 1969.\n- Guitar World has been published since July 1980.\n- Guitar World is a monthly music magazine devoted to guitarists.\n- Golf Digest is a monthly golf magazine published by Condé Nast Publications in the United States.\n- Golf Digest is headquartered in Des Moines, Iowa.\n- Daron Malakian was ranked 30th in Guitar World's list The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time.",
